  - Gap: matches omit player metadata and enqueue throws on repeat calls, blocking polling workflows.
  - Quality: strict 100% coverage required; both npm and pytest suites must pass.
Position:
  - Convert enqueue to an async, poll-friendly status endpoint and hydrate matches with sanitized player profiles.
Recommendations:
